.SS "template<uint32_t dim> \fBOperand\fP< dim > & \fBcsmp::Operand\fP< dim >::operator+= (const \fBOperand\fP< dim > & op)"
Transforms the basic variable associated with the lefthand \fBOperand\fP by the right-side \fBOperand\fP variable using the arithmetic operators +, -, *, or / \&. The C++ short form for writing a = a + b; as a += b; is used in such expressions\&. Since only the mathematical transformation is defined, the other internal variables of the lefthand \fBOperand\fP will not be affected by a call to one of these operators\&.

.PP
